    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YASUKE: A Lost Descendant</strong> is a kinetic 3D anime action game where you strike with purpose and move with style. Play as Tanaka Yasuke, a young hero discovering his legacy as the heir to the legendary African samurai. Battle across the futuristic nation of N10N-KOKU using high-velocity parkour, dynamic swordplay, and supernatural power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/f9470ef4790e97bf39fe571235f956f2.avif?t=1749137283\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SLASH WITH STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express your fighting style with three distinct combat stances \u2014 Lion, Cheetah, and Rhino \u2014 each with its own rhythm and intent. Chain combos, unleash devastating STYLE attacks, and adapt to each fight with fluid precision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/9c4423fd5b1411b722ae3dd6a26fdb28.poster.avif?t=1749137283\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/9c4423fd5b1411b722ae3dd6a26fdb28.webm?t=1749137283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/9c4423fd5b1411b722ae3dd6a26fdb28.mp4?t=1749137283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>MOVE WITH VELOCITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run walls, grind rails, and glide across rooftops in a world built for motion. Your parkour-infused maneuvers aren't just how you move \u2013 they're how you fight. Build momentum and turn it into a weapon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/8a044ef003c14b63f8a16d23cae44797.poster.avif?t=1749137283\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/8a044ef003c14b63f8a16d23cae44797.webm?t=1749137283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/8a044ef003c14b63f8a16d23cae44797.mp4?t=1749137283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>CHANNEL YOUR LEGACY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the Shiryoku, a mysterious force that lets you manipulate your environment. Pull debris, hurl projectiles, swing through the air, and reshape the battlefield to your advantage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/33293ef28fa4b2a0279a741f4715c29a.poster.avif?t=1749137283\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/33293ef28fa4b2a0279a741f4715c29a.webm?t=1749137283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/33293ef28fa4b2a0279a741f4715c29a.mp4?t=1749137283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>CLAIM YOUR FUTURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vibrant districts of N10N-KOKU \u2014 a futuristic nation pulsing with global culture, anime-inspired style, and high-stakes conflict. Face rival clans, bond with your teammates, and fight for a future built on rhythm, rebellion, and legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/66ef53f77d7201aaae985b514d0c5b9e.poster.avif?t=1749137283\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/66ef53f77d7201aaae985b514d0c5b9e.webm?t=1749137283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/66ef53f77d7201aaae985b514d0c5b9e.mp4?t=1749137283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YASUKE: A Lost Descendant</strong> is a kinetic 3D anime action game where you strike with purpose and move with style. Play as Tanaka Yasuke, a young hero discovering his legacy as the heir to the legendary African samurai. Battle across the futuristic nation of N10N-KOKU using high-velocity parkour, dynamic swordplay, and supernatural power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/f9470ef4790e97bf39fe571235f956f2.avif?t=1749137283\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SLASH WITH STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express your fighting style with three distinct combat stances \u2014 Lion, Cheetah, and Rhino \u2014 each with its own rhythm and intent. Chain combos, unleash devastating STYLE attacks, and adapt to each fight with fluid precision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/9c4423fd5b1411b722ae3dd6a26fdb28.poster.avif?t=1749137283\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/9c4423fd5b1411b722ae3dd6a26fdb28.webm?t=1749137283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/9c4423fd5b1411b722ae3dd6a26fdb28.mp4?t=1749137283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>MOVE WITH VELOCITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run walls, grind rails, and glide across rooftops in a world built for motion. Your parkour-infused maneuvers aren't just how you move \u2013 they're how you fight. Build momentum and turn it into a weapon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/8a044ef003c14b63f8a16d23cae44797.poster.avif?t=1749137283\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/8a044ef003c14b63f8a16d23cae44797.webm?t=1749137283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/8a044ef003c14b63f8a16d23cae44797.mp4?t=1749137283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>CHANNEL YOUR LEGACY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the Shiryoku, a mysterious force that lets you manipulate your environment. Pull debris, hurl projectiles, swing through the air, and reshape the battlefield to your advantage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/33293ef28fa4b2a0279a741f4715c29a.poster.avif?t=1749137283\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/33293ef28fa4b2a0279a741f4715c29a.webm?t=1749137283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/33293ef28fa4b2a0279a741f4715c29a.mp4?t=1749137283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>CLAIM YOUR FUTURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vibrant districts of N10N-KOKU \u2014 a futuristic nation pulsing with global culture, anime-inspired style, and high-stakes conflict. Face rival clans, bond with your teammates, and fight for a future built on rhythm, rebellion, and legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/66ef53f77d7201aaae985b514d0c5b9e.poster.avif?t=1749137283\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/66ef53f77d7201aaae985b514d0c5b9e.webm?t=1749137283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/66ef53f77d7201aaae985b514d0c5b9e.mp4?t=1749137283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Dash. Slash. Glide. Discover your legacy as the heir to a legendary African samurai in this high-velocity 3D action game, featuring futuristic swordplay, kinetic parkour, and anime-inspired action.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201c...mix in ultimate attacks, team-based moves \u00e0 la Hi-Fi Rush, and the vaulting, wall-running, and swinging we love from Assassin's Creed, and YASUKE: A Lost Descendant is shooting right up my most-anticipated games list.\u201d<br>GamesRadar+<br><br>\u201cIf you want to support an indie studio that admires Japanese culture \u2026 you should add the game to your wishlist now\u201d<br>4gamer\u2022net (Japan)<br>",
